[{"id":"Mzk-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{1}{\\left ( 1+\\sqrt{2} \\right )\\left ( 2+\\sqrt{3} \\right )\\left ( 1-\\sqrt{2} \\right )\\left ( 2-\\sqrt{3} \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{1}{\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;1+\\sqrt{2}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;2+\\sqrt{3}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;1-\\sqrt{2}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;2-\\sqrt{3}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" />&nbsp;adalah bilangan ...</p>","choices":["tak rasional positif","tak rasional negatif","rasional tidak bulat","bulat positif","bulat negatif"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTcwOA"},{"id":"Mzk-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada gambar di samping, a, b, c, d dan e berturut-turut menyatakan besar sudut pada titik-titik ujung bintang lima yang terletak pada suatu lingkaran. Jumlah a + b + c + d + e&nbsp; =</p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c7d58955-f417-d7a4-9eae-f6a100c682bb\"><img style=\"border: none; transform: rotate(0rad); display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/Pgii7G6y-md47kOVmeDTIlQcMGpOpM6U_NwFneeNHxW0BS4x6YbdZG5iMyKufu87D4Sbnkj2dsKVsIPvpAtW6ojMzuepuijrHfVQtOyYBmL_QcUEIp99lEnAVPln6cozhiGEERVPVjCzmeW19Q\" width=\"120\" height=\"117\" /></span></p>","choices":["<img title=\"135^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?135^{\\circ}\" />","<img title=\"180^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?180^{\\circ}\" />","<img title=\"270^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?270^{\\circ}\" />","<img title=\"360^{\\circ}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?360^{\\circ}\" />","tidak dapat ditentukan dengan&nbsp; pasti"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg4Nw"},{"id":"Mzk-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Semula harga semangkuk bakso dan harga segelas jus masing-masing adalah Rp. 5000. Setelah kenaikan BBM, semangkuk bakso harganya naik 16% sedangkan harga segelas jus naik 4%. Kenaikan harga dari semangkuk bakso dan segelas jus adalah</p>","choices":["8%","10%","12%","15%","20%"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg4OA"},{"id":"Mzk-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika a bilangan real yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img title=\"a^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a^{2}\" /> &lt; a,&nbsp; maka&nbsp;</p>","choices":["negatif","a &lt; 1","1 &lt; a","&frac12; &lt; a &lt; 2","tidak ada a yang memenuhi"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg4OQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Aries menggambar bagian dari parabola y = <img title=\"x^{2} - 6x + 7\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;6x&amp;space;+&amp;space;7\" />. Titik-titik parabola yang&nbsp; muncul dalam gambar memiliki absis mulai dari 0 sampai +4. Maka ordinat terkecil dan ordinat terbesar titik-titik pada parabola yang muncul dalam gambar berturut-turut&nbsp; adalah</p>","choices":["&minus;2 dan &minus;1","&minus;2 dan 7","&minus;1 dan 7","0 dan &minus;1","0 dan 7"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5MA"},{"id":"Mzk-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dua buah dadu dilemparkan bersamaan. Berapakah peluang jumlah angka yang muncul adalah 6 atau 8 ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{5}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{5}{36}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{7}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{7}{36}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{10}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{10}{36}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{14}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{14}{36}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{35}{36}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{35}{36}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5MQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Titik A(a, b) disebut titik letis jika a dan b keduanya adalah bilangan bulat. Banyaknya titik letis pada lingkaran yang berpusat di O dan berjari-jari 5 adalah</p>","choices":["4","6","8","12","tidak bisa dipastikan</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5Mg"},{"id":"Mzk-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Mana di antara 5 ekspresi berikut yang angka terakhirnya berturut-turut bukan 5, 6, 8, 9 atau 0 ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img title=\"5^{5^{5^{5}}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?5^{5^{5^{5}}}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"6^{6^{6^{6}}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?6^{6^{6^{6}}}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"8^{8^{8^{8}}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?8^{8^{8^{8}}}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"9^{9^{9^{9}}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?9^{9^{9^{9}}}\" />","&nbsp;<img title=\"10^{10^{10^{10}}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10^{10^{10^{10}}}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5Mw"},{"id":"Mzk-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan tiga bilangan positif x, y dan z yang semuanya berbeda. Jika&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{y}{x-z}=\\frac{x+y}{z}=\\frac{x}{y}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{y}{x-z}=\\frac{x+y}{z}=\\frac{x}{y}\" />&nbsp;, maka nilai&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{x}{y}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{x}{y}\" />&nbsp;sama dengan</p>","choices":["1/2","3/5","1","2","10/3"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5NA"},{"id":"Mzk-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika diberikan persamaan&nbsp;<img title=\"(x2 - x-1)^{x+2}=1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?(x2&amp;space;-&amp;space;x-1)^{x+2}=1\" />, maka banyaknya bilangan bulat&nbsp;<img title=\"x\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x\" />&nbsp;yang merupakan solusi dari persamaan tersebut adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["2","2","4","5","6"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5NQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Faktor prima terbesar dari 2005 adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5Ng"},{"id":"Mzk-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan semua solusi |x-1|+|x-4=2.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5Nw"},{"id":"Mzk-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan a dan b adalah bilangan real tak nol yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img title=\"9a^{2} - 12ab + 4b^{2} = 0.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?9a^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;12ab&amp;space;+&amp;space;4b^{2}&amp;space;=&amp;space;0.\" /></p><p>Tentukan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{a}{b}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{a}{b}\" />.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5OA"},{"id":"Mzk-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan dua buah persegi, A dan B, dimana luas A adalah separuh dari luas B. Jika keliling B adalah 20 cm, maka keliling A, dalam centimeter adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTg5OQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Seorang siswa mempunyai dua celana bewarna biru dan abu-abu, tiga kemeja bewarna putih, merah muda dan kuning, serta dua pasang sepatu bewarna hitam dan coklat. Banyaknya cari siswa tersebut memakai pakaian dan sepatu adalah...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwMA"},{"id":"Mzk-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan semua bilangan real x yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img title=\"x^{4}+\\frac{1}{x^{4}}\\leq 2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{4}+\\frac{1}{x^{4}}\\leq&amp;space;2\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwMQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan semua bilangan tiga angka sehingga bilangan itu adalah 30 kali jumlah ketiga angka itu</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwMg"},{"id":"Mzk-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai sin<img title=\"^{8}75^{\\circ}-cos^{8}75^{\\circ}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?^{8}75^{\\circ}-cos^{8}75^{\\circ}=\" />...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwMw"},{"id":"Mzk-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui bahwa segiempat ABCD memiliki pasangan sisi yang sejajar. Segiempat tersebut memiliki tepat satu sumbu simetri lipat jika sia berbentuk . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwNA"},{"id":"Mzk-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan banyaknya pasangan bilangan bulat positif (m,n) yang merupakan solusi dari persamaan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{4}{m}+\\frac{2}{n}=1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{4}{m}+\\frac{2}{n}=1\" />.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTkwNQ"},{"id":"Mzk-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>dev test</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM4Nzc"}]
